WEBVTT

00:07:27.693 --> 00:07:30.237
just before a major function or event

00:07:30.237 --> 00:07:32.198
so that your friends would notice?

00:07:32.198 --> 00:07:36.368
Or do you tell yourself
you only take taxis late at night,

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:40.122
but then realize that you're taking
way more taxes every month

00:07:40.164 --> 00:07:41.415
than you thought?

00:07:41.457 --> 00:07:44.084
Are you working late
more than you thought?

00:07:44.126 --> 00:07:46.837
There's so much that we can
learn about ourselves

00:07:46.879 --> 00:07:48.714
if we take the time to look.

00:07:48.756 --> 00:07:53.594
And sometimes our money knows us
better than we know ourselves.

00:07:53.636 --> 00:07:58.015
Tracking our finances
can reveal what we are in denial of,

00:07:58.057 --> 00:07:59.642
our hidden biases,

00:07:59.683 --> 00:08:03.145
our fears and what
might be holding us back.